---
layout: layout.njk
title: "whatis.foundation"
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">

  {# ── Site intro ── #}
  <div class="mb-16 space-y-4 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-600">A Sacred Educational Course</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-6xl">WHAT IS. FOUNDATION?</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
      A 99-meeting course built on a parable of light, the prism, the tablets, and the rainbow staircase. God is light. The prism guides our travel. The tablets carry the ten words. The rainbow is a staircase of light. Guided forward, we become light.
    </p>
  </div>

  {# ── Session Zero ── #}
  <div class="mb-16 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600">Session Zero</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ course.intro.title }}</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Meeting 0</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">{{ course.intro.details }}</p>
  </div>

  {# ── Five Parts ── #}
  {% for part in course.parts %}
  <section id="{{ part.id }}" class="mb-20">

    {# Part header #}
    <div class="mb-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-600">Part {{ part.number }}</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ part.title }}</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">{{ part.subtitle }}</p>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-slate-600 leading-7">{{ part.overview }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Meeting cards — 2-col on sm, 4-col on lg #}
    <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for meeting in part.meetings %}
      <article id="meeting-{{ meeting.number }}" class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft">

        {# Card image / header #}
        <div class="relative flex h-40 flex-col justify-end bg-gradient-to-br {{ part.color }} p-5">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] {{ part.labelColor }}">Meeting {{ meeting.number }}</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold leading-snug text-white">{{ meeting.title }}</h3>
        </div>

        {# Card body #}
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-400">Brief</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">{{ meeting.description }}</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">{{ meeting.details }}</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-4">
            <a href="#meeting-{{ meeting.number }}" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-700">Open meeting</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

</section>
